    "text": "15 hours ago CLARION, Pa. --- The College Sports Communicators (CSC) announced their 2025 Academic All-District honorees in the sport of women's soccer on Tuesday. Four members of the Golden Eagles soccer team - Reese Aquilio, Paige Brewer, Leah Deal and Hailey Dobb - earned the honor this season. To be eligible for... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
